Instance: UGIMMZElements
InstanceOf: Library
Title: "UGIMMZElements"
Description: "Doses administered to the client, grouped the way the Uganda routine immunisation schedule counts them. Builds on the data elements and value sets of the WHO Immunization IG."
Usage: #definition
* insert UGLogicLibrary( UGIMMZElements )

Instance: UGIMMZScheduleLogic
InstanceOf: Library
Title: "UGIMMZScheduleLogic"
Description: "Scheduling logic for the Uganda routine immunisation schedule (UNEPI): next dose, due date and expiration of each vaccine."
Usage: #definition
* insert UGLogicLibrary( UGIMMZScheduleLogic )
